<title>USA: Box Energy mystified by stock activity.</title>
<headline>Box Energy mystified by stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Box Energy Corp said on Tuesday it did not know any reason for unusual activity in its stock trading, or a decline in its price.</p>
<p>Box closed at 8-1/2, down 3/8 of a point for the day. Its 52-week high was 13.</p>
